   "AnchorBarGrid"], Cell["Spinors, Momenta and Spin Sums", "GuideTitle"],
  Cell["Represent and manipulate angle brackets, square brackets, momentum \
chains and spin indices.", "GuideAbstract"], Cell["SpinorChain displays \
HEPCAT expressions in angle and square bracket notation. Spinor endpoints \
distinguish massless helicity spinors, massive spin spinors and auxiliary \
reference spinors. Mom and Multiparticle describe momentum insertions without \
turning them into external particles.", "GuideAbstract"],
  Cell["External labels, little-group indices and reference labels have \
separate meanings. ChooseSpinIndices selects explicit spin indices; \
ReverseMomentum crosses an external momentum; PermuteParticles relabels \
particles consistently.", "GuideAbstract"], Cell["Build Expressions",
   "GuideFunctionsSubsection"],
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Spinor", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/Spinor"], ": ", "Represents a massless \
helicity spinor, a massive spin spinor, or an auxiliary reference spinor."}],
   "GuideText"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["SpinorChain", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/SpinorChain"], ": ", "Represents an \
angle or square spinor bracket, optionally with an ordered sequence of \
momentum insertions."}], "GuideText"],
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["SpinorTrace", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/SpinorTrace"], ": ",
     "Represents the ordered chiral trace of momentum matrices."}],
   "GuideText"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Mom", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/Mom"], ": ",
     "Represents a momentum insertion in HEPCAT spinor algebra."}],
   "GuideText"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Mass", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/Mass"], ": ",
     "Represents the symbolic mass assigned to a particle or a channel."}],
   "GuideText"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Multiparticle",
      BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/Multiparticle"],
     ": ", "Labels a sum of external particle momenta."}], "GuideText"],
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["MultiparticleDiff", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/MultiparticleDiff"], ": ", "Represents \
a legacy composite label for a difference of particle momenta."}],
   "GuideText"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["PropDen", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/PropDen"], ": ",
     "Represents an off-shell physical propagator denominator."}],
   "GuideText"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["MomProd", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/MomProd"], ": ",
     "Represents a Lorentz scalar product of particle or composite momenta."}]\
, "GuideText"], Cell["Spin Indices and Squaring",
   "GuideFunctionsSubsection"],
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["ChooseSpinIndex", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/ChooseSpinIndex"], ": ",
     "Selects a physical spin projection for one external massive particle."}]\
, "GuideText"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["ChooseSpinIndices",
